%p
  Someone submitted the website feedback form, but the relay to the feedback
  Google Form failed — most likely the form was edited and the site's field
  mapping is stale (see HomeController#submit_feedback), or Google was
  unreachable.
%p
  %strong This email is the only copy of their submission
  — it is not in the response spreadsheet.

%p
  %strong Name:
  = @name
%p
  %strong Contact details:
  = @contact
- if @incident.present?
  %p
    %strong Time and date of incident:
    = @incident
%p
  %strong Feedback:
= simple_format(@feedback)
